Package: SynPALM
Title: Synthetic Phenotype Assisted Linear Mixed Models Improve
       Proteome-Wide Genetic Discovery in Incomplete Biobank Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Haoyu", "Yang", email = "haoyuyang@hsph.harvard.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A specialized statistical framework for enhancing GWAS power by leveraging 
    synthetic/surrogate phenotypes in the presence of missing target phenotypes 
    and genetic relatedness.
